    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000150'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B1', 3, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"The villages whose were damaged ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"by the earthquake ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"received emergency supplies ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"within two days.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The villages that were damaged by the earthquake received emergency supplies within two days.', '«Whose» debe ir seguido de un sustantivo poseído; aquí se necesita «that» como sujeto de la pasiva.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000151'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B1', 1, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"The fieldwork was postponed ","after":" heavy rain made the roads impassable.","options":[{"id":"A","text":"because of","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Because of» y «despite» necesitan un grupo nominal, mientras «although» expresa contraste."},{"id":"B","text":"despite","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Because of» y «despite» necesitan un grupo nominal, mientras «although» expresa contraste."},{"id":"C","text":"because"},{"id":"D","text":"although","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Because of» y «despite» necesitan un grupo nominal, mientras «although» expresa contraste."}]}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The fieldwork was postponed because heavy rain made the roads impassable.', '«Because» introduce una cláusula completa de causa.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000152'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B1', 2, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"","after":" the sample is kept below zero, it will remain stable.","options":[{"id":"A","text":"Unless","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Unless» invertiría la condición y las otras opciones expresan relaciones distintas."},{"id":"B","text":"Despite","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Unless» invertiría la condición y las otras opciones expresan relaciones distintas."},{"id":"C","text":"As long as"},{"id":"D","text":"Whereas","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"«Unless» invertiría la condición y las otras opciones expresan relaciones distintas."}]}'::jsonb, 'C', 'As long as the sample is kept below zero, it will remain stable.', '«As long as» expresa la condición suficiente para mantener estable la muestra.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000153'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B1', 3, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"The team left early ","after":" it could reach the station before dark.","options":[{"id":"A","text":"because of","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Las demás expresiones señalan causa o contraste, no propósito."},{"id":"B","text":"even though","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Las demás expresiones señalan causa o contraste, no propósito."},{"id":"C","text":"so that"},{"id":"D","text":"in spite of","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Las demás expresiones señalan causa o contraste, no propósito."}]}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The team left early so that it could reach the station before dark.', '«So that» introduce una cláusula de propósito con sujeto y modal.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000154'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B1', 1, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"","after":" the two methods use different equipment, they produce similar results.","options":[{"id":"A","text":"Because of","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La relación lógica no es de causa, condición negativa ni propósito."},{"id":"B","text":"Unless","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La relación lógica no es de causa, condición negativa ni propósito."},{"id":"C","text":"Although"},{"id":"D","text":"So that","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La relación lógica no es de causa, condición negativa ni propósito."}]}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Although the two methods use different equipment, they produce similar results.', '«Although» introduce una concesión que contrasta con el resultado principal.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000155'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B1', 2, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"Despite the weather was cold, ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"the students completed ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"the field survey ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"as originally planned.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Although the weather was cold, the students completed the field survey as originally planned.', '«Despite» no introduce una cláusula finita; con sujeto y verbo se usa «although».', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000156'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B1', 3, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"The device automatically shuts down unless the temperature ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"does not fall ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"below the ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"safe limit.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The device automatically shuts down unless the temperature falls below the safe limit.', '«Unless» ya significa «if not»; añadir «does not» crea una doble negación.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000157'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B1', 1, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"The archive ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"remains closed ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"so that workers ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"are repairing the damaged ceiling.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The archive remains closed because workers are repairing the damaged ceiling.', 'La cláusula explica una causa, no un propósito; corresponde «because».', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
