    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000271'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B2', 1, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"To reduce measurement errors, ","after":".","options":[{"id":"A","text":"the device was recalibrated","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Un sujeto pasivo o inanimado puede crear un modificador colgante si no realiza la acción inicial."},{"id":"B","text":"recalibration was performed","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Un sujeto pasivo o inanimado puede crear un modificador colgante si no realiza la acción inicial."},{"id":"C","text":"measurement errors were reviewed","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Un sujeto pasivo o inanimado puede crear un modificador colgante si no realiza la acción inicial."},{"id":"D","text":"the technicians recalibrated the device"}]}'::jsonb, 'D', 'To reduce measurement errors, the technicians recalibrated the device.', 'El sujeto implícito del infinitivo debe ser quien realiza la acción de reducir y recalibrar.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000272'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B2', 2, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"After reading the report, ","after":".","options":[{"id":"A","text":"more data were requested","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La frase inicial no puede modificar lógicamente a «data», «report» o «questions»."},{"id":"B","text":"the report seemed incomplete","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La frase inicial no puede modificar lógicamente a «data», «report» o «questions»."},{"id":"C","text":"several questions remained","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La frase inicial no puede modificar lógicamente a «data», «report» o «questions»."},{"id":"D","text":"the director requested more data"}]}'::jsonb, 'D', 'After reading the report, the director requested more data.', 'El sujeto de la cláusula principal debe ser también quien leyó el informe.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000273'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B2', 3, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"Nearly impossible to detect without special equipment, ","after":".","options":[{"id":"A","text":"researchers developed a sensor","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Si aparece primero una persona, la frase parece decir que esa persona es imposible de detectar."},{"id":"B","text":"the laboratory installed alarms","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Si aparece primero una persona, la frase parece decir que esa persona es imposible de detectar."},{"id":"C","text":"workers receive training","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"Si aparece primero una persona, la frase parece decir que esa persona es imposible de detectar."},{"id":"D","text":"the gas poses a serious risk"}]}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Nearly impossible to detect without special equipment, the gas poses a serious risk.', 'El adjetivo inicial debe describir directamente al sujeto inmediato «the gas».', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000274'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'sentence_completion', 'B2', 1, '{"kind":"sentence_completion","before":"Using satellite images, ","after":" changes in the coastline.","options":[{"id":"A","text":"changes were documented by the team","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La voz pasiva puede dejar sin referente lógico al gerundio inicial."},{"id":"B","text":"the coastline showed","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La voz pasiva puede dejar sin referente lógico al gerundio inicial."},{"id":"C","text":"the images revealed by the team","misconceptionCode":"FORM_OR_STRUCTURE","feedback":"La voz pasiva puede dejar sin referente lógico al gerundio inicial."},{"id":"D","text":"the team documented"}]}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Using satellite images, the team documented changes in the coastline.', 'El sujeto «the team» es quien usa las imágenes y documenta los cambios.', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000275'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B2', 2, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"Driving through the mountains, ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"the ancient ruins ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"appeared unexpectedly beside ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"the road.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'A', 'As the travelers drove through the mountains, the ancient ruins appeared unexpectedly beside the road.', 'La cláusula inicial debe nombrar a quienes conducen para no modificar erróneamente a «the ancient ruins».', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
    ('30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000276'::uuid, '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028'::uuid, 'error_identification', 'B2', 3, '{"kind":"error_identification","segments":[{"text":"To improve ","optionId":"A"},{"text":"water ","optionId":"B"},{"text":"quality, ","optionId":"C"},{"text":"the town was installed a new filtration system near the reservoir.","optionId":"D"}]}'::jsonb, 'D', 'To improve water quality, the town installed a new filtration system near the reservoir.', 'El sujeto «the town» realiza la acción y necesita la voz activa «installed», no «was installed».', 'published', 1, 'Contenido original Macitta; revisión lingüística y de fairness v1.', true, true),
